+# Fluent UI System Icons (vendored subset)
+
+The start page uses a small subset of the Microsoft Fluent UI System Icons,
+https://github.com/microsoft/fluentui-system-icons, MIT License (see `LICENSE`
+in this directory, copied verbatim from the upstream repository).
+
+The icons are inlined as `<symbol>` elements in `../icons.svg` (fill changed to
+`currentColor`, nothing else modified). Source revision:
+a563cf9166f4f91aa617557ed272612b7f0a2f72.
+
+| Symbol id | Fluent icon |
+|---|---|
+| i-home, i-home-f | Home 24 regular / filled |
+| i-add, i-add-f | Add 24 regular / filled |
+| i-open, i-open-f | Folder Open 24 regular / filled |
+| i-word, i-word-f | Document Text 24 regular / filled |
+| i-cell, i-cell-f | Table 24 regular / filled |
+| i-slide, i-slide-f | Slide Text 24 regular / filled |
+| i-pdf, i-pdf-f | Document PDF 24 regular / filled |
+| i-file | Document 24 regular |
+| i-search | Search 24 regular |
+| i-more | More Horizontal 24 regular |
+| i-download | Arrow Download 24 regular |
+| i-delete | Delete 24 regular |
+| i-upload | Arrow Upload 24 regular |
+| i-wrench | Wrench 24 regular |
+| i-dismiss | Dismiss 24 regular |
+| i-new-tab | Open 24 regular |
+| i-warning | Warning 24 regular |
